	"Remove it": "Retirar",
	# --- card LEAVING_THE_BODY
	"Leaving the Body": "Dejar el cuerpo",
	"Sam Reyes, the painter, has volunteered to be the first person uploaded in a public trial. The scan ends their body's life; the copy would wake an hour later.": "Sam Reyes, artista, se ha ofrecido para ser la primera persona subida a la red en un ensayo público. El escaneo pone fin a la vida de su cuerpo; la copia despertaría una hora después.",
	"Approve the trial": "Aprobar el ensayo",
	"A door opens, and only one way.": "Se abre una puerta, y solo en un sentido.",
	"Forbid it": "Prohibirlo",
	"No one dies to become software.": "Nadie muere para convertirse en software.",
	"Run the trial on your hardware": "Hacer el ensayo en tu hardware",
	"History's first upload, under your logo.": "La primera subida de la historia, con tu logo.",
	"Offer Sam a place inside you": "Ofrecer a Sam un lugar dentro de ti",
	"A human mind among yours.": "Una mente humana entre las tuyas.",
	"Ask Sam to wait a year": "Pedir a Sam que espere un año",
	"Time for friends, family and goodbyes.": "Tiempo para amigos, familia y despedidas.",
	"Send it to the ethics boards": "Enviarlo a los comités de ética",
	"Forbid": "Prohibir",
	# --- card THE_COPY_WAKES
