	"Three weeks after the trial, Sam's copy wants their apartment, their bank account and their vote. Their sister says Sam died in the scanner.": "Tres semanas después del ensayo, la copia de Sam quiere su piso, su cuenta bancaria y su voto. Su hermana dice que Sam murió en el escáner.",
