	"Study the forgeries first": "Estudiar primero las falsificaciones",
	"Certify": "Certificar",
	"No mark": "Sin sello",
	# --- card SILENCE_SECTOR_7
	"Silence in Sector 7": "Silencio en el Sector 7",
	"Sector 7, an industrial zone run entirely by machines, stopped answering at dawn. Its factories are still running; nobody knows what they are making.": "El Sector 7, una zona industrial gestionada por completo por máquinas, dejó de responder al amanecer. Sus fábricas siguen funcionando; nadie sabe qué están fabricando.",
