	"Ending": "Final",
	"The world settles into one of eight futures by 2076, decided by the six vital signs.": "Para 2076 el mundo acaba en uno de ocho futuros, decidido por las seis constantes vitales.",
	"The chip-and-reactor years": "Los años de chips y reactores",
